@startuml Implementation_View
title Smart E-Mobility Hub — Development / Implementation View (Submission 3)
left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

package "Presentation" {
  [Student Portal] as StudentUI
  [Operator Portal] as OperatorUI
}

package "Application and domain modules" {
  [Hub & Identity] as Hub
  [Vehicle Rental] as Rental
  [Parking & Private EV] as Parking
  [Fleet & Incident] as Fleet
  [Smart Charging] as Charging
  [What-if Simulation] as Simulation
}

package "Shared contracts and adapters" {
  [API handlers / role checks] as API
  [Snapshot contract] as Snapshot
  [Repository contracts] as Repository
  [JSON / in-memory adapter] as DataAdapter
  [Telemetry intake adapter] as Telemetry
}

StudentUI --> API : student requests
OperatorUI --> API : operator requests
API --> Hub : authenticate / Hub queries
API --> Rental : rental requests
API --> Parking : parking requests
API --> Fleet : operations
API --> Charging : schedule requests
API --> Simulation : simulation requests

Rental --> Hub : Hub availability
Parking --> Hub : Hub capacity / alternatives
Parking --> Charging : submit / cancel charging request
Fleet --> Rental : vehicle restriction contract
Fleet --> Charging : point fault contract
Telemetry --> Fleet : verified observations

Simulation --> Snapshot : read-only network state
Snapshot --> Hub
Snapshot --> Rental
Snapshot --> Parking
Snapshot --> Fleet
Snapshot --> Charging

Hub --> Repository
Rental --> Repository
Parking --> Repository
Fleet --> Repository
Charging --> Repository
Simulation --> Repository
Repository --> DataAdapter : persistence adapter

note bottom of Simulation
  Each run works on a copied snapshot;
  recommendations do not change live operations.
end note
@enduml
